  "description": "Discord: https://discord.gg/an72N6h8 Caspian Agent Challenge: Top 3 Get Accelerator Interviews Don’t just build an AI agent. Put it to work. Build an agent using Caspian, deploy it, and get real people to use it, whether that’s your customers, friends, teammates, or community. We’re looking for agents that create consistent, meaningful usage throughout the challenge , not a one-day spike. What we’re judging: Message volume & usage: 40% How many messages does your agent handle per day? How consistently is it being used? Use case & impact: 25% Who is using it and what real problem does it solve? Creativity: 20% Is the use case interesting and different? Implementation: 15% How well does the agent use Caspian and perform in practice? We’ll look at daily message volume, active days, number of users, and consistency of activity. Top projects will also go through a short interview. We want to understand who was actually using the agent, whether customers, friends, teammates, or others, and how the agent was serving them. Selected projects and their developers will be featured by Caspian. The Top 3 winners will get a direct interview with one of India’s top accelerators. Build something people actually use. GitHub: https://github.com/TryCaspian/caspian-sdk Docs: https://www.trycaspianai.com/docs/ Discord: https://discord.com/invite/A28qnkvgCM",
