    "details": "<p><strong>Discord: https://discord.gg/an72N6h8<br /><br />Caspian Agent Challenge: Top 3 Get Accelerator Interviews</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Don&rsquo;t just build an AI agent. Put it to work.</li>\n<li>Build an agent using Caspian, deploy it, and get real people to use it, whether that&rsquo;s your customers, friends, teammates, or community.</li>\n<li>We&rsquo;re looking for agents that create <strong>consistent, meaningful usage throughout the challenge</strong>, not a one-day spike.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What we&rsquo;re judging:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Message volume &amp; usage: 40%</strong><br />How many messages does your agent handle per day? How consistently is it being used?</li>\n<li><strong>Use case &amp; impact: 25%</strong><br />Who is using it and what real problem does it solve?</li>\n<li><strong>Creativity: 20%</strong><br />Is the use case interesting and different?</li>\n<li><strong>Implementation: 15%</strong><br />How well does the agent use Caspian and perform in practice?</li>\n</ul>\n<p>We&rsquo;ll look at <strong>daily message volume, active days, number of users, and consistency of activity.</strong></p>\n<p>Top projects will also go through a short interview. We want to understand who was actually using the agent, whether customers, friends, teammates, or others, and how the agent was serving them.</p>\n<p><strong>Selected projects and their developers will be featured by Caspian.</strong></p>\n<p>The <strong>Top 3 winners will get a direct interview with one of India&rsquo;s top accelerators.</strong></p>\n<p>Build something people actually use.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GitHub: <a href=\"https://github.com/TryCaspian/caspian-sdk\">https://github.com/TryCaspian/caspian-sdk</a></li>\n<li>Docs: <a href=\"https://www.trycaspianai.com/docs/\">https://www.trycaspianai.com/docs/</a></li>\n<li><strong>Discord:</strong> <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/A28qnkvgCM\">https://discord.com/invite/A28qnkvgCM</a></li>\n</ul>",
